#. default-sha256: 3406b49e37c624f765ca4cf08b4ef2755e1c1eee93a8b2ce8bf18a5a21f0da16
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A0DBAAC_D426_42C5_921F_9B4005812851"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Until around the time I turned seventeen,⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫my life was mostly uneventful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"17세 생일까진 평화로운 나날을 보냈어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4A0DC88F_34D9_40EF_ADFC_B77F3EC02EC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78386342f97992cb21d7c18b0a54c9bb300f45469572feb0a6cbb24cf54ba133
#. default-sha256: a720662ed3c4d6fcb98ea89214f248983d4da7727e11185aff3a96fe2cddc34b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4A0DC88F_34D9_40EF_ADFC_B77F3EC02EC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You have the same flax-colored hair as me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but yours always seemed to glisten "
"in the sun,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나랑 똑같은 아마빛 머리칼을 한 네가……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63C0553A_2BF8_403B_8F8B_D3C168C58921
