msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you saying..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……그건……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5F88ED1F_1464_46E6_9A85_A320528C2618
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2003f7c8afe62435254c3ec3d9e22bcb6e823e15d9509fbc52ca5953e1249b8
#. default-sha256: c531bfd4a06b4fe504139268951f2f4022dea91d79c4abdddcdd4fb3444d7506
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5F88ED1F_1464_46E6_9A85_A320528C2618"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right. I’ll make something, then!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Start off with some fruit jam... ⟪k:4⟫"
"then maybe make a pie out of it!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그럼 넬리가 뭐 만들게! ⟪k:2⟫우선 잼을 만들고서, ⟪k:3⟫그래~, ⟪k:4⟫그걸 파이로 만들자!"

