#: scenario8:scenario8_34B52276_67B5_4158_8090_18838F65E3D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecc5323fd430ec413d1930f83d76736c0a6aed39714daf4b5aac1561e73e8632
