msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫While I had been given some money, my supply was far from infinite."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫자금이 있다지만, ⟪k:3⟫그건 얼마 안 가서 거덜날 양이었어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f9ad60e0364ede09a451f4ac82871dc1999a35d49a5bf0838d671b8b7a26ece
#. default-sha256: e82eb352e3b3e779a657113a06a9373f65a0280edcf108ead4ff2cce4b00eab1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I would eventually have to find some kind of work—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫some way to support "
"myself and Nellie—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 나는 ⟪k:1⟫빨리 일자리든 뭐든 ⟪k:2⟫먹고 살 수단을 얻어야 했는데――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cef39fa43007978d9af47289e759ad694d9add1a3a86b82e59dd0c871e2d655
#. default-sha256: b3749d7228cdf0aaf2791ec7897246d69b1692878c649237254dfc2ffd38a257
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even so, it was still a constant stream of new experiences for the two of us, having been "
"pampered our entire lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫뭐, ⟪k:1⟫아무것도 없긴 해도, ⟪k:2⟫온실 속 화초인 우리 입장에선 ⟪k:3⟫죄다 색달랐지만."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ACCF1210_14B3_4155_8256_1D728A00FD16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93e42c2bc6637010a3920b79bc28067b4b8f1f62f570607aed47662a8c54fa70
