msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ACCF1210_14B3_4155_8256_1D728A00FD16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the idea.⟪k:3⟫You like chicken though, don’t you?⟪k:4⟫Steamed especially, "
"if I remember right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫응, ⟪k:3⟫그래도 ⟪k:4⟫넬리는 닭 요리 좋아하지? ⟪k:5⟫찜닭을 ⟪k:6⟫특히."

#: scenario8:scenario8_339AB65A_00A0_461B_A2E8_B2246435DD9A
