msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5620DC6B_D38F_475C_B386_28368EC6165F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22df4419a763e8207d42490d2ad92094142511e62e321213fba38400b10775ae
