#: scenario8:scenario8_7703992D_0920_4D95_88B2_BCA12616A36C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44fe0728fe95a67727f15582aabcf1b8ff8fd94496f81a9565a42a8dbc0dfee2
