msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7703992D_0920_4D95_88B2_BCA12616A36C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I stood there, dumbfounded, like my soul had been sucked from my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 멍해졌어. ⟪k:1⟫넋이 나간 것처럼 ⟪k:2⟫멍해져 가지고……, ⟪k:3⟫아무 말도 못 했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_44B77388_953A_434E_99EF_F761D6DDC356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 407815abe113813a1e998f6b35908a997c65d6faea35c2fa1f1410a6c5e437d6
