msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_44B77388_953A_434E_99EF_F761D6DDC356"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...What are her symptoms?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……증상은요……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2309615B_CFDA_4903_9738_9BD67A636B0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c184b73a4f46f9f284f2cdd9802d430eba5eb3660ebdad958f57d8f43bc84c81
#. default-sha256: bf9e1c6173e973df7ee301a434ec9198d6f83581d63e66ee541d5fc120d9acbe
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2309615B_CFDA_4903_9738_9BD67A636B0D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’re going to want to lower her fever first...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After that, get her on a nutritious "
"diet.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’m going to give you two medications..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그럼 ⟪k:1⟫열부터 내려야겠네요……. ⟪k:2⟫열이 내려가면 영양가 있는 걸 먹이세요. ⟪k:3⟫약초는 두 "
"종류 드릴게요……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4F5291E7_CDA5_4C26_B597_E4181D5FAAB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93afff06187112045bf8aa36a2077f4466347cc0461d173c6e11be7ed830a321
