msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Most of her face was covered by a black hood, so all I could see was her mouth and chin, but "
"even that much was harrowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫후드로 눈가를 가리고 있어서 ⟪k:1⟫보인 건 입가 정도였는데⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……그래도 비참했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_70F924A4_7A6B_48A8_9B29_6B8565026318
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f9b188881a8743a7b69a5d30fc3ce935861f4543c1c32d4563981765de22a56
#. default-sha256: 996a88581974f76dd804d4cd49a0fc38a2c4f6973c70d3724bd4bda2c48e24f0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_70F924A4_7A6B_48A8_9B29_6B8565026318"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and I couldn’t let myself hurt her, so I suppressed my own disgust and put on my best smile."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫상처를 안 입히려고…… ⟪k:1⟫나는 ⟪k:2⟫내 혐오감을 숨기고 ⟪k:3⟫웃기로 했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3DF9E984_36A3_4FD4_9859_B01A3F148EBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96ffab5fa8627ba381564967a64b19a3be2a198babfd410f7cbd140ee1d55e2e
