msgid "⟪k:0⟫And when she saw my face, a look of surprise seemed to cross hers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 애는 내 미소를 보고 ⟪k:1⟫조금 ⟪k:2⟫놀란 눈치더라……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ED4CDAD3_9406_4A81_8D4C_2582F0B5912A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 653188037e75e8e6fcfe469b3178d7c0b7db530cd7c1b40fd724a5c3a39c1948
