msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The witch’s herbs did, indeed, seem to help some.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Going to visit her was "
"better than talking to any of the local doctors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫마녀에게 받은 약초는 ⟪k:2⟫효과가 ⟪k:3⟫조금 있었어.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫도시 의사를 찾아가는 것보다 "
"⟪k:6⟫나은 것 같았지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6B21BAD5_1A8D_490B_9F34_1841DF3AE660
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a88c197d5bd4f257191ee8ed223fd638a6489df26e4fc4d7f840a8b482ae48d1
#. default-sha256: 94a98719d60df6a3692aaa7ccb70bd7214c170efd1295cea9a7e3132edb54698
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6B21BAD5_1A8D_490B_9F34_1841DF3AE660"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, Nellie hadn’t been cured.⟪k:1⟫She was only feeling a little bit better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫조금 나아진 정도라―― ⟪k:2⟫역시 넬리는 회복이 안 됐어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E3360607_EB4D_4ACE_995B_335038D89B17
