msgid "⟪k:0⟫And every time I went to that cottage and heard her sweet voice,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그때마다 문 너머에서 목소리가 들렸는데, ⟪k:1⟫나는 그 애 얼굴을 알아서 ⟪k:2⟫꺼림칙하긴 했어도"
"――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B8A3DF5_9868_413A_B963_69D4DA8ADC2F
