"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Great weather, isn’t it? I love the way the sun reflects off the surface of "
"the lake. It’s gorgeous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫오늘은 날씨가 좋아서 다행인걸. ⟪k:4⟫햇살이 ⟪k:5⟫호수 표면에 반사돼서 반짝거"
"려. ⟪k:6⟫참 예쁘지 않아?"

