msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was a good dream, and that’s what matters.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It must have been the saint "
"lady’s power at work!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도 ⟪k:2⟫나쁜 꿈은 아니었어. ⟪k:3⟫성녀님의 ⟪k:4⟫힘이겠지?"

