msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The miracle took place... ⟪k:3⟫but it didn’t persist?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That doesn’t make "
"much sense."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫기적은 발현되었을 텐데요……, ⟪k:3⟫그게 지속되지 않는다니 ⟪k:4⟫기묘하군요."

