msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I assure you, my Father does not want to see two young souls like yourselves torn "
"apart, ⟪k:2⟫and neither do I..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫당신들의 젊은 인연이 ⟪k:2⟫벌써 끊기는 건 아버지께서도 바라지 않으실 거예요. ⟪k:3⟫그건 "
"⟪k:4⟫저도………"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F550B980_B27D_4DEB_919E_C2DEC109E19C
