msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I was ⟪k:1⟫with⟪k:2⟫ Morgana, listening to her words of reassurance, she, without fail, "
"wiped away all the doubt I had."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫게다가 ⟪k:1⟫실제로 모르가나를 만나서 ⟪k:2⟫말을 듣다 보면……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그게 무조건 ⟪k:5⟫옳은 것"
"만 같아져."

