"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was asleep in her bed, so I quietly rose from my seat and made my way to the door, "
"trying not to wake her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫침대에는 새근새근 자는 넬리가 있어서…… ⟪k:1⟫나는 넬리를 안 깨우게끔 ⟪k:2⟫조용히 일어서서 "
"⟪k:3⟫문으로 갔어."

