"⟪k:0⟫I had an inkling of a suspicion, but having been raised in such a sheltered environment,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫불길한 예감은 ⟪k:1⟫들었어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫하지만 나는 ⟪k:4⟫모르고 있었지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2C016AAC_2E31_4B7B_82B6_014555D57079
