msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t understand exactly how dangerous it was to thoughtlessly open the door to anyone "
"who came knocking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫오랫동안 ⟪k:1⟫생각 없이…… 온실에서만 자란 나는―― ⟪k:2⟫부주의하게 문을 여는 게 ⟪k:3⟫얼마나――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_21AEF992_3C87_4898_8DC2_15B2BFA2CC2A
