"⟪k:0⟫O Father who art in Heaven... ⟪k:1⟫please forgive me... ⟪k:2⟫for what I am about to do... "
"⟪k:3⟫Please... ⟪k:4⟫please forgive me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫주님……, ⟪k:1⟫부디…… 용서해 주세요……, ⟪k:2⟫주님……, ⟪k:3⟫주님……!"

